WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.596
Settings contains information shared across the website.

00:00:04.646 --> 00:00:10.001
Update the company name and description, phone, WhatsApp, email, address,

00:00:10.051 --> 00:00:10.741
and hours.

00:00:10.791 --> 00:00:15.849
The map link and office coordinates control the location information.

00:00:15.899 --> 00:00:20.440
These content changes use the same draft and publish workflow.
